  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">GCF-EBRD SEFF Co-financing Programme</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sustainable Energy Financing Facilities is an on-lending programme that will provide credit lines to local partner financial institutions (PFIs) in developing countries with the aim to create selfsustaining markets in the areas of energy efficiency , renewable energy and climate resilience.

&#x2022; The program contributes mainstreaming energy efficiency and renewable energy financing in the financial sector through stimulating both supply and demand for such climate change activities. 
&#x2022; The program promotes local capacity and is aligned with the notion of country ownership.
&#x2022; The program scales up systematic financing towards renewable energies, energy efficiency and climate resilience in 10 countries.</narrative>
  </description>
